        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Birstall Shopping Park, Junction 27 Retail Park, Sweden\n- Companies: IKEA, Forbes\n- People: Ingvar Kamprad\n- Topics: retail specialization, furniture retailing, wealth rankings\n\nFacts:\n- IKEA was founded in Sweden in 1943 by 17-year-old Ingvar Kamprad.\n- IKEA has been the world's largest furniture retailer since at least 2008.\n- Forbes Magazine listed Ingvar Kamprad in 2015 as one of the ten richest people in the world, with a fortune worth more than 40 billion dollars.\n- Junction 27 Retail Park is adjacent to Birstall Shopping Park.\n- Junction 27 Retail Park specializes in bulky goods and electronics.",
